OL,3,GNEWSAMen jailed after student raped and
OL,4,Adumped in road
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been jailed after a
OL,7,Fstudent was raped, filmed and dumped in
OL,8,Fa rural road after she was picked up in
OL,9,Fa car hired for the sole purpose of
OL,10,Fattacking someone.
OL,12,FArjan Purewal, Jaskaran Thandi and
OL,13,FHassan Jangheer drove their victim up
OL,14,Fand down Broad Street in Birmingham in
OL,15,FSeptember 2023 before heading to the
OL,16,FClent Hills in Worcestershire.
OL,18,FShe was filmed by Purewal as she was
OL,19,Fsubjected to a serious sexual assault
OL,20,Fbefore being dumped in Vine Lane in
OL,21,FClent at about 03:30 BST.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
